{"id":"wb-8-715","name":"云南大学会泽院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"会泽院","text":"会泽院，又称会泽楼，位于中国云南省昆明市五华区翠湖北路2号、云南大学东陆校区内，建于1923-1924年，工程师张邦翰设计，为东陆大学的第一批教学楼之一，亦为今云南大学的标志性建筑。现为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%9A%E6%B3%BD%E9%99%A2","revisionId":86783126,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783126","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2c77d0d3f1263f2cceba59c3.jpg","title":"云南大学会泽院_2024-01-28_08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%91%E5%8D%97%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E6%B3%BD%E9%99%A2_2024-01-28_08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/%E4%BA%91%E5%8D%97%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E6%B3%BD%E9%99%A2_2024-01-28_08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​云南大学会泽院","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"会泽院"}}